<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Pancon half year net profit soars.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Pancon half year net profit soars.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to December 31</p>
<p>			(million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit	     8.85 vs 10.71</p>
<p>    Net profit		    14.69 vs 3.82</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)	     nil  vs nil</p>
<p>NOTE: Pancontinental Mining Ltd is controlled by Goldfields Ltd.  </p>
<p>    Sales			   76.61 vs 161.36</p>
<p>    Other income		  10.51 vs 6.02</p>
<p>    Abnormals			 nil vs nil</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)		     6.0 vs 1.6</p>
<p>    Tax		     credit 5.84 vs charge 6.88</p>
<p>    Interest			 1.59 vs 7.19</p>
<p>    Depreciation		  13.74 vs 29.85</p>
<p>Note: Tax in latest half consists of abnormal tax credit of A$7.36 million and a charge of A$1.52 million.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373 1800</p>
</text>
